{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部宣布，中共中央政治局委員、外長王毅，將作爲國家主席習近平特別代表，出席本月15日在阿塞拜疆巴庫召開的亞洲相互協作與信任措施會議第七次峰會，並在本月14日至20日訪問阿塞拜疆、克羅地亞、黑山和保加利亞。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:55.862484+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:22:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T14:38:03.584629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:43.246751+00:00","content_hash":"255b80815e2bcdbaaa4e458b675950951ee6adb4ffcb61d8890085867f9d3d01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}